# Left by pre-2026-08 harness runs, which put the server's user.home and caches inside the
# workspace -- destructive when that workspace was a real project. They now go to a temp
# directory removed on shutdown; these stay ignored so old checkouts do not resurface them.
.user-home/
.server-system/
.xdg/
